# Implementation Plan - Database Import

Import the large [mtg.sql](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/assets/mtg.sql) file (152MB) into the UniServerZ MySQL/MariaDB instance using the command line for reliability.

## Proposed Changes

### Database Import
- Use the [mysql.exe](file:///f:/UniServerZ/core/mysql/bin/mysql.exe) binary located at [f:\UniServerZ\core\mysql\bin\mysql.exe](file:///f:/UniServerZ/core/mysql/bin/mysql.exe).
- Run the import command: `f:\UniServerZ\core\mysql\bin\mysql.exe -u root < f:\UniServerZ\www\coolex_shop\assets\mtg.sql`
- Note: No password is used as per standard UniServerZ defaults.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Verification
- Run `SHOW DATABASES;` to confirm `mtg` exists.
- Run `SELECT COUNT(*) FROM mtg.mtg_cards_raw;` to confirm data was imported.
- Check for any errors in the command output.

### Manual Verification
- None required as this is a backend data import.
